  "releaseNotes": "0.7.0 extends the format plugin SPI: EncoderOptions.Configuration selects the configuration used for saving, plugins can attach HDR gain maps (GainMapMetadata, GainMapImage, ImageDecodeContext.AttachGainMap) and read or rewrite metadata without pixels (IImageFormatMetadataCodec). No breaking API changes; adds end-to-end tests, CLI metadata and streaming resize, and a migration guide from 0.5.0. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.7.0/docs/releases/release-0.7.0.md",
